<p><strong>Time complexity:</strong> The time complexity of <code>knapsack<=
/code> is <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D=
"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretch=
