rd mathnormal">a</span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">p</span><span class=
=3D"mclose">)</span></span></span></span> because each cell of the DP table=
 is populated once.</p>
<p><strong>Space complexity:</strong> The space complexity is <span class=
=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/19=
98/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi=
>n</mi><mo>=E2=8B=85</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=3D"fals=
e">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">O(n\cdot cap)</a=
nnotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=
=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" style=3D"height: 1em; =
