pan><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">p</span><span class=3D"mclose">)</span>=
</span></span></span> because we're maintaining a DP table that stores <spa=
n class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3=
.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi>n<=
