<h2 id=3D"optimization">Optimization</h2>
<p>We can optimize the solution by recognizing that, for each cell in the D=
P table, we only need access cells from the row below it.</p>
<p>Therefore, we only need to maintain two rows:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>curr_row</code>: the current row being populated.</li>
<li><code>prev_row</code>: the row below the current row.</li>
</ul>
